			"notes": "Roofify shows the bedrock under the Nether roof. This release covers all 17 stable Minecraft Java Edition versions from **1.21 through 26.3**.\n\nChoose **one** JAR for your exact Minecraft version and place it in your client's `mods` folder.\n\n- **Fabric or Quilt** — choose `-fabric-quilt.jar` and install Fabric API for the same Minecraft version. Mod Menu provides the optional settings screen.\n- **NeoForge** — choose `-neoforge.jar`. Open settings through the built-in Mods screen.\n\n**B** toggles labels and **N** cycles the three display modes. Roofify reads existing `config/roofify.yaml` settings. The scanner now reads only the roof and the four layers underneath it.\n\nJava 21 is required for the 1.21 series and Java 25 for the 26 series. `SHA256SUMS` lists the checksum of every release JAR."
		}
